---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---
<section class="hero">
  <p class="hero-eyebrow">🔍 Evidence-based breakdowns</p>
  <h1>You've probably misunderstood something.</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Every claim in our videos and posts, backed by sources you can check yourself.</p>
</section>

<section class="post-grid">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
  <a class="post-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
    <p class="post-card-eyebrow">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</p>
    <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
    {% if post.data.claim %}<p class="post-card-claim">{{ post.data.claim }}</p>{% endif %}
    <span class="post-card-link">View evidence →</span>
  </a>
  {% else %}
  <p class="empty-state">No posts yet — check back soon.</p>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
